    {
      "end" : 306.1999816894531,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 305.0799865722656,
      "text" : "those things are licensed"
    },
    {
      "end" : 309.8799743652344,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 306.6199951171875,
      "text" : "when the people come in and they apply for licenses."
    },
    {
      "end" : 311.3999938964844,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 310.739990234375,
      "text" : "- Yes, yes,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 311.3999938964844,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 311.3999938964844,
      "text" : "yes."
    },
    {
      "end" : 313.41998291015625,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 311.5799865722656,
      "text" : "- So you don't really need a space for them,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 314.6399841308594,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 313.6999816894531,
      "text" : "especially if they're portable."
    },
    {
      "end" : 316.97998046875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 314.8999938964844,
      "text" : "- Well, if you're planning, you have"
    },
    {
      "end" : 319.760009765625,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 317.1199951171875,
      "text" : "to sort of plan, okay, well, maybe a truck like that"
    },
    {
      "end" : 321.8600158691406,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 319.94000244140625,
      "text" : "could park there, okay, and it wouldn't get in the way"
    },
    {
      "end" : 323.32000732421875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 321.9599914550781,
      "text" : "of other things, okay, yeah."
    },
    {
      "end" : 325.760009765625,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 323.67999267578125,
      "text" : "It wouldn't necessarily be right next to the children,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 326.8600158691406,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 325.8600158691406,
      "text" : "it would be more next"
    },
    {
      "end" : 326.8600158691406,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 326.8600158691406,
      "text" : "to them."
    },
    {
      "end" : 327.8000183105469,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 326.8600158691406,
      "text" : "- They can have an area with"
    },
    {
      "end" : 328.7400207519531,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 327.8000183105469,
      "text" : "benches around"
    },
    {
      "end" : 328.760009765625,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 328.7400207519531,
      "text" : "it."
    },
    {
      "end" : 330.05999755859375,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 328.760009765625,
      "text" : "- Benches, right, yeah."
    },
    {
      "end" : 331.5400085449219,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 330.2799987792969,
      "text" : "- To make it accessible so"
    },
    {
      "end" : 332.6600036621094,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 331.5400085449219,
      "text" : "other people can sit."
    },
    {
      "end" : 334.2200012207031,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 332.9599914550781,
      "text" : "- A few picnic tables."
    },
    {
      "end" : 335.5400085449219,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 334.2200012207031,
      "text" : "- Picnic tables, that could"
    },
    {
      "end" : 336.1000061035156,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 335.5400085449219,
      "text" : "work, yeah."
    },
    {
      "end" : 337.1199951171875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 336.260009765625,
      "text" : "- Picnic tables could work."
    },
    {
      "end" : 338.58001708984375,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 337.2200012207031,
      "text" : "- Of like some people can feed"
    },
    {
      "end" : 339.08001708984375,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 338.58001708984375,
      "text" : "the pigeons."
    },
    {
      "end" : 341.44000244140625,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 339.32000732421875,
      "text" : "- I think you can think about internet access too."
    },
    {
      "end" : 345.70001220703125,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 341.52001953125,
      "text" : "You'll have an area that could be a Wi-Fi,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 352.8000183105469,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 346.7200012207031,
      "text" : "We have Wi-Fi that's available to people coming in and working at the park."
    },
    {
      "end" : 354.8999938964844,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 353.1400146484375,
      "text" : "Yeah, in Tel Aviv, that's a city issue."
    },
    {
      "end" : 357.20001220703125,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 355.0299987792969,
      "text" : "Yeah, you do have coverage."
    },
    {
      "end" : 358.17999267578125,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 357.6100158691406,
      "text" : "Yeah, that's right."
    },
    {
      "end" : 359.02001953125,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 358.25,
      "text" : "So that's an advantage."
    },
    {
      "end" : 359.2400207519531,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 359.1000061035156,
      "text" : "message."
    }
  ],
